hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2210","[AI-translation] Imepokewa kutoka kwa Anas (Radhiya Allaahu 'anhu) alisema: Lau si kwamba nilimsikia Nabii (Swalla Allaahu 'alayhi wa sallam) akisema: Msitamani mauti — ningelitamani. (Bukhari: 7233)"
"2211","[AI-translation] Imepokewa kutoka kwa Abu Hurayra (Radhiya Allaahu 'anhu): Kwamba Mtume wa Mwenyezi Mungu (Swalla Allaahu 'alayhi wa sallam) amesema: Asitamani mmoja wenu mauti — ama akiwa mwema, huenda akaongezeka; na ama akiwa muovu, huenda akapata radhi (ya Mwenyezi Mungu kwa kutubia). (Bukhari: 7235) [Kitabu cha Kushikamana na Qur'ani na Sunna]"
